=== layout: one-panel

# Breakout Room Chat

@body

- State your name, major, and post-grad plans
- [You can genetically modify one animal. What would you change?]{color=red}
- Choose a farm animal, pet, or wild species.
- Explain the useful trait and one possible tradeoff.
- If no one is talking, please be the first to speak.

